7. AI FEATURES (Gemini API, with sensible fallbacks when AI is unavailable)
---------------------------------------------------------------------
- AI planner (section 6).
- Pre-visit brief: one tap gives a dealership summary, history, last notes, profile (group, size, F&I system), products of interest, talking points and likely objections.
- Post-visit assistant: turns rough or voice notes into a structured visit log, suggests the next step and follow-up date, captures product interest, and judges whether the prospect is HOT.
- Lead scoring: ranks prospects using dealership size, used inventory, group membership, F&I system, product interest and engagement, and explains why ("Top 5 to visit today").
- Handoff briefing auto-drafted for the manager from the full record history.
- Upsell and restock AI: predicts restock dates and quantities, and suggests upsells by comparing a client to similar dealerships (same size, same F&I system, same group) and what those bought. Warns of churn risk.
- Group expansion AI: when one rooftop signs, suggests a plan for the sister rooftops.
- Manager AI dashboard: deals most likely to close, deals at risk, reps who need help and why, and suggested coaching actions.
- Executive AI summary: a plain-English weekly, monthly and quarterly narrative with highlights, concerns and recommendations.
- Action extraction: pulls commitments and next steps out of emails, Meet notes and in-person notes, and suggests them as tasks for the user to approve.
- Natural-language search and commands, e.g. "hot prospects within 20 miles of Dallas not visited in 2 weeks".
- Propose any other AI add-ons that would clearly help any role, and build the best ones.

