8. GAMIFICATION (healthy, transparent competition)
---------------------------------------------------------------------
- Leaderboards (weekly, monthly, quarterly; by region and team) for visits, good-time visits, claims converted, handoffs, wins, signings, upsells, restocks, client health and complete dealership profiles.
- Points (configurable weights), streaks (e.g. consecutive days of good-time visits), badges, achievements and levels. Include badges for upsell wins, restock orders, complete profiles and signing a full dealer group.
